        15 @ Logging...
        >>> logger.level("WARNING", icon=r"/!\\")
        Level(name='WARNING', no=30, color='<yellow><bold>', icon='/!\\\\')
        >>> logger.warning("Updated!")
        30 /!\\ Updated!
        """
